    "body": "Hmmm. Certainly it would be pretty broken if it was discarded when there's a direct reference to it. I suppose it should be changed to say that it is disconnected from the `iframe` element, such that `contentWindow` is `null` and if you insert the same `iframe` to the document again, it gets a new browsing context.\n\nhttp://software.hixie.ch/utilities/js/live-dom-viewer/saved/4214\n",
