    "created_at": "2016-07-12T03:15:55Z",
    "updated_at": "2016-07-12T03:15:55Z",
    "body": "I think the \"otherwise\" case is meant to apply in the \"no top-level browsing context\" case. The spec never allows `windowProxy.top` to be null.\n\nWe may want to align the spec with the majority of browser implementations, however. Preferably at the same time as trying to clean up all of these related issues...\n",
    "author_association": "MEMBER",
    "pin": null,
