    "created_at": "2016-07-12T21:06:14Z",
    "updated_at": "2016-07-12T21:06:14Z",
    "body": "I've executed that plan as https://github.com/whatwg/html/pull/1539. It clarifies that in the case of the OP, the nested browsing context should be discarded, and it makes the normative change that top/parent/frameElement then return null, which at least matches 2/4 browsers as opposed to the current spec's 0/4. Careful review appreciated.\n",
    "author_association": "MEMBER",
    "pin": null,
